OL,3,GNEWSAPositive steps in footballer's
OL,4,Abrain tumour treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage footballer who is undergoing
OL,7,Ftreatment for a brain tumour is "doing
OL,8,Fwell", her family have said.
OL,10,FRoxy Thomas, 18, who plays for Torquay
OL,11,FUnited Women, was diagnosed in August
OL,12,Fand is in intensive care at Bristol
OL,13,FRoyal Infirmary after two operations.
OL,15,FA statement on behalf of her family
OL,16,Fsaid for the first time since the
OL,17,Foperation Roxy had been "able to
OL,18,Fbreathe on her own for short periods"
OL,19,Fand "although these spells are still
OL,20,Fbrief, this is a positive step
OL,21,Fforward".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
